d-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Estado neurológico actual: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Retraso madurativo global grado moderado a severo.</span></p><div style=""text-align: justify;""><br></div><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Tratamiento:</span></p><ul style=""margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Histórico: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Ácido Valproico, Risperidona (suspendido por somnolencia excesiva), Clobazam, Quetiapina, Fenobarbital.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Actual:</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">&nbsp;</span></p></li><ul style=""padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Carbamazepina 200 mg 2 - 1 - 2.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Levetiracetam 1000 mg 1/2 - 1/2.</span></p></li></ul></ul><div style=""text-align: justify;""><br></div><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Enfermedad actual:</span></p><ul style=""margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Historia de su epilepsia: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">La primera crisis fue a los 5 años y medio, durante la vigilia, hermanos vieron caída del torso a izquierda con postura tónica generalizada. Fue al Hospital Marzetti. Fue medicado con Logical y luego continuo seguimiento en Hospital Garrahan. Continuó con crisis cada 2-3 días, madre relata que elevaba el brazo derecho con movimientos distales (automatismo? no eran clonias), al mismo tiempo que sialorrea. Luego postura tónica generalizada. A veces llegaba a avisar “con el cuerpo/la mirada”, el paciente no recuerda nada. Se ajustó dosis sin respuesta. En 2011 se añade Clobazam y posteriormente se rota Valproico a Levetiracetam, sin respuesta. Por trastorno conductual, tomó durante periodos, Risperidona y posteriormente Quetiapina.&nbsp; A los 18 años, empezó a cambiar características: dejando de tener esas descritas y empezó a tener sonidos guturales y posteriormente tónico clónico generalizado con frecuencia aprox de 1-2 por mes. En algún momento, agrega retropulsión del cuerpo hacia atrás con múltiples eventos de traumatismos craneoencefálicos, deja de caerse a los 23 años. Refiere, que desde 2020, presenta movimientos involuntarios tipo hipermotoras de golpeteo de mano sobre mesa o espalda, o brincos sobre sí mismo, parado o sentado, sin ruptura de contacto, frecuencia diaria, pluricotidiana.</span></p></li></ul><div style=""text-align: justify;""><br></div><ul style=""margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Semiología de crisis:</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Tipo 1: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Desde los 5 hasta los 18 años aprox. Frecuencia aprox 1 cada 2-3 días.</span></p></li><ul style=""padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Subjetivamente: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">&nbsp;Niega.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Objetivamente: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">&nbsp;elevación del MSD con movimientos distales (automatismo?), al mismo tiempo que sialorrea. Luego postura tónica generalizada con retropulsión del cuerpo hacia atrás.</span></p></li></ul><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Tipo 2: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Desde los 18 hasta la actualidad. Frecuencia aprox de 1-2 por mes.</span></p></li><ul style=""padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Subjetivamente: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">&nbsp;Niega.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Objetivamente: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">&nbsp;sonidos guturales y posteriormente tónico clónico generalizado, con retropulsión hacia atrás.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Última crisis en noviembre de 2025, previo a julio de 2025.</span></p></li></ul><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Tipo 3: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Desde los 23 años hasta la actualidad. Frecuencia diaria, pluri cotidiana,</span></p></li><ul style=""padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Subjetivamente: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">&nbsp;Niega.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Objetivamente: </span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">movimientos involuntarios tipo hipermotoras de golpeteo de mano sobre mesa o espalda, o brincos sobre sí mismo, parado o sentado, sin ruptura de contacto.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></ul><div style=""text-align: justify;""><br></div><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Estudios:</span></p><ul style=""margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">EEG (HCANK jul/25):</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;""> Trazado anormal por presencia de lentificación leve generalizada en forma continua y actividad epileptiforme generalizada a predominio anterior en forma frecuente.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">RM Epi (HCANK ago/25):</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;""> Se identifica área focal de encefalomalacia en reborde medial de ambas regiones frontobasales en proyección de surco olfatorio, siendo más significativa del lado izquierdo, presentan pérdida de volumen tisular. Se interpretan de carácter secuelar posiblemente vinculada a traumatismo craneal, valorar en contexto clínico y antecedentes del paciente. Otra pequeña área de encefalomalacia se observa en reborde medial y anterior del polo temporal derecho. Los hipocampos presentan señal conservada, sin evidenciarse asimetrías. Secuencia de difusión sin imágenes con restricción de señal. Sistema ventricular de aspecto conservado. Tronco del encéfalo y hemisferios cerebelosos sin evidencia de lesiones.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Citogenético (2011):</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;""> negativo con polimorfismo 22pstk+.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Estudio molecular para cromosoma X frágil (2012):</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;""> negativo.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Estudio mutación del gen HFE de la hemocromatosis (2013):</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;""> negativo.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""1"" style=""list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">VEEG (Neuraxis 2013):</span><span style=""font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;""> Según resumen de HC, informa versión oculocefálica a izquierda asociado a elevación de MSI, en ocasiones leves clonías&nbsp; MMSS y relajación esfinteriana + EEG ictal actividad rápida con ligero predominio hemisferio izquierdo 6-8 seg duración.</span></p></li></ul><div style=""text-align: justify;""><br></div><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Conclusiones:</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">Paciente con Epilepsia farmacorresistente y Retraso Madurativo en protocolo de evaluación para Cirugía de Epilepsia/VNS.</span></p></span></div><div style=""text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); font-weight: bold; font-size: 17px; margin-top: 18px; color: rgb(8, 82, 148);"">Indicaciones recibidas:</div><ul style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108); font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); padding-left: 20px;""><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Carbamazepina 200 mg VO</span>&nbsp;(200 mg 1 - X - 2 Comp.ORAL) descenso parcial</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Levetiracetam 1000 mg</span>&nbsp;(500 mg c/12 horas Comp.ORAL)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Paracetamol 500 mg</span>&nbsp;(500 mg Si dolor Comp.ORAL)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Enoxaparina</span>&nbsp;(40 mg SC 1 vez al día)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Acceso venoso</span>&nbsp;(Acceso venoso periférico intermitente)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">CSV</span>&nbsp;(Control de signos vitales x turno)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Dieta</span>&nbsp;(Dieta general - paciente y un familiar)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Precaución</span>&nbsp;(Barandas elevadas con posibilidad de estadía en sillón en forma periódica - previo aviso al personal técnico)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Cabecera</span>&nbsp;(A no menos de 30 grados)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Lorazepam 4 mg amp</span>&nbsp;(4 mg bolo EV lento SOLO en caso de status epiléptico y previa supervisión médica. De no ceder crisis en 5 minutos repetir 1 vez más)</li><li style=""text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Levetiracetam 500 mg amp</span>&nbsp;(4500 mg en 250 ml de SF EV a pasar en 10 minutos SOLO en caso de status epiléptico refractario a lorazepam y previa supervisión médica)</li></ul><div style=""text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); font-weight: bold; font-size: 17px; margin-top: 18px; color: rgb(8, 82, 148);"">Datos específicos:</div><div style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108); white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-align: justify;"">Se internó en la Unidad de Epilepsia y Neurofisiología para la realización de videoelectroencefalograma por telemetría de 24 horas para caracterización de los eventos descriptos. Se realizaron durante la misma métodos de activación en forma reiterada (hiperventilación, estimulación lumínica intermitente, privación de sueño y descenso de fármacos anticonvulsivantes). </div><div style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108); white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-align: justify;"">El paciente se encontró estable durante la internación.</div><div style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108); white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-align: justify;"">Se restauró dosis de fármacos anticrisis y se otorga alta hospitalaria en el día de la fecha.</div>0000False1ctrlEVO_ListasDestino100False0491162=Alta médica hospitalaria1ctrlEVO_yesnoAISLAMINTO POSITIVO21000False0AISLAMINTO POSITIVO #VALOR1ctrlEVO_rtfIndicaciones<ul style=""margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); padding-inline-start: 48px;""><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;"">Carbamazepina 200 mg 2 - 1 - 2.</span></p></li><li dir=""ltr"" aria-level=""2"" style=""list-style-type: circle; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;""><p dir=""ltr"" role=""presentation"" style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;""><span style=""font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; 