alva posterior</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;52x64x51</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;en íntimo</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;contacto con sistema calicial medio</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">,&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">pedículo renal conservado.</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">(T1B)</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">Oct 24:&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">Eco&nbsp; Vejiga paredes lisas</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;""><b>Pr 124</b>&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">PSA</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">6.25</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">Ago 25 :&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">STUI Nx3, Chorro fuerte, niega SVI.&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">-PSA 10.6&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;TR&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">G III</span><span style=""font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"">&nbsp;FA sin nódulos&nbsp;</span>- Cr &nbsp; 1.18</p><p style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108);""><span id=""docs-internal-guid-7608876f-7fff-71f2-f40e-61b3448a244a""></span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; line-height: 1.38;""><b style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108);"">24/9/2025 SE REALZIA NEFECTOMIA RADICAL IZQUIERDA ABIERTA + DRENAJE.&nbsp;</b><font color=""#676a6c""><b>PACIENTE CON AP - Estadificación histológica: PT1b PN0&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">SEP 25&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;RMN PIRADS 2&nbsp;La glándula prostática mide 69mm x 58mm x 82 mm, con un volumen estimado de 172 cc.<span style=""color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"">&nbsp;</span><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">&nbsp;(cargada como archivo en historia clinica)</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;"">Herida en buenas condiciones , retiro puntos</p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">Refiere buen chorro miccional, actualmente con tamsulosina</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); line-height: 1.38;""><span style=""font-weight: 700;"">NOV 25:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>31/10/25 Uroflujometria :&nbsp; Qmax: 14.0 Qprom: 6.0 Vtotal: 185.5 Rpm: 0ML</p><p style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108);"">EN EL MOMENTO ASINTOMATICO , REFIERE QUE SE SIENTE CONFORME CON SU MICCION , SE INDICA SEGUIMIENTO CON LAB + TC EN 6 MESES&nbsp;</p><p style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108);""><b>Abril 26:</b>&nbsp; En seguimiento con Nefrologia. Labo&nbsp; 02/26&nbsp; Cr 1.94</p><p style=""color: rgb(103, 106, 108);"">Pendiente Tomografia de control.&nbsp;</p>1000False1ctrlEVO_rtfESTUDIOS SOLICITADOS0000False1ctrlEVO_rtfTRATAMIENTO0000False1ctrlEVO_practicaslistaPractica/s Realizada/s12547601<root><listitem idpractica=""54760"" alias=""CON00001 Consulta médica o profesional."" nombre=""CON00001 Consulta médica o profesional."" /><listitem idpractica=""54761"" alias=""CON00002 Teleconsulta."" nombre=""CON00002 Teleconsulta."" /><listitem idpractica=""54767"" alias=""CON00008 Elaboración de informe para presentar en otro organismo. Gestiones extramurales."" nombre=""CON00008 Elaboración de informe para presentar en otro organismo. Gestiones extramurales."" /><listitem idpractica=""54768"" alias=""CON00009 Consulta de seguimiento farmacoterapeutico"" nombre=""CON00009 Consulta de seguimiento farmacoterapeutico"" /></root>";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;1139;1;17/04/2026 13:54:37;1139;1;17/04/2026 13:58:18;;;0;;;0;0
