order-box; font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">1 muestra de suero para Anti MOG</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.152; text-align: justify; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;""><span style=""box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;""><br></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; -<span style=""font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">1 de suero pareada con 1 de LCR para BOC.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.152; text-align: justify; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;""><span style=""box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">-Solicitar Ic salud mental</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.152; text-align: justify; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;""><span style=""box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;""><br></span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.152; text-align: justify; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;""><span style=""box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">-PTe. Lab con serologías, p.reumatológico, ERS, TSH y B12</span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0pt 0px; line-height: 1.152; text-align: justify; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;""><span style=""box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"">-EMG eventual, se aguardan el resto de los estudios.</span></p><p><span id=""docs-internal-guid-f54217a1-7fff-096a-7d3a-0092933dfe65""></span></p><p dir=""ltr"" style=""box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0pt 0px 8pt; line-height: 1.152; text-align: justify;""><br style=""box-sizing: border-box;""></p>1000False1";;;;;;;;;;58307;;;;;;88;1;17/04/2026 15:07:05;88;1;17/04/2026 15:17:35;;;0;;;0;0
